---
// Problem vs Solution Transformation — Why customer communications break and how NewRelay fixes it
---

<section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-[#FAF9FF]/60 border-y border-slate-100 relative overflow-hidden">
  
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-14 sm:mb-18">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-100/70 border border-purple-200 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-[#635BFF] mb-4">
        <span>Why customer communications break</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#100F12] tracking-tight font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans'] leading-[1.12]">
        Disconnected channels cost you deals, reviews, and customers
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-[#5F5E6E] leading-relaxed">
        When your team juggles 5 different apps, messages get lost, response times blow out, and high-intent buyers slip away.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Comparison Grid (Chaos vs NewRelay) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto items-stretch">
      
      <!-- LEFT CARD: The Multi-App Chaos -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-red-100 p-7 sm:p-9 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(239,68,68,0.04)] flex flex-col justify-between">
        
        <div>
          <!-- Header -->
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5 mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-slate-100">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-red-50 border border-red-200 flex items-center justify-center text-red-500 shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                <line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"></line>
                <line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"></line>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#100F12]">The Multi-App Chaos</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-[#5F5E6E]">Tabs, lost passwords & scattered notifications</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 4 Concrete Pain Points -->
          <div class="space-y-4">
            
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-50 text-red-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 font-bold text-xs">
                ✕
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#100F12]">Slow response times & lost leads</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5F5E6E] mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">Inquiries sit unread for hours across personal WhatsApps and IG DMs while buyers check competitors.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-50 text-red-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 font-bold text-xs">
                ✕
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#100F12]">Double replies & internal confusion</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5F5E6E] mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">Two agents reply to the same customer with contradictory answers without realizing it.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-50 text-red-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 font-bold text-xs">
                ✕
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#100F12]">Negative reviews caught too late</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5F5E6E] mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">Frustrated clients leave 1-star reviews publicly because there was no quick way to resolve issues internally.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-50 text-red-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 font-bold text-xs">
                ✕
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#100F12]">Zero context on customer history</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5F5E6E] mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">Your support reps have no idea what the customer bought last week or what was discussed in email.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-red-600 font-semibold">
          <span>Average reply time: 3.8 hours</span>
          <span>Lead conversion rate: ~4%</span>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- RIGHT CARD: The NewRelay Connected Workspace -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-purple-200/90 p-7 sm:p-9 shadow-[0_16px_40px_rgba(99,91,255,0.08)] flex flex-col justify-between relative">
        
        <div class="absolute -top-3.5 right-8 bg-[#635BFF] text-white text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-sm">
          The NewRelay Advantage
        </div>

        <div>
          <!-- Header -->
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5 mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-purple-100">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 flex items-center justify-center text-[#635BFF] shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#100F12]">One Connected Command Center</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-[#5F5E6E]">All channels, team inbox, automation & reviews</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 4 Concrete Solutions -->
          <div class="space-y-4">
            
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
                  <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#100F12]">Sub-minute response times with smart routing</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5F5E6E] mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">Instant automated qualification + smart assignment to the right specialist in seconds.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
                  <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#100F12]">Shared drafts & collision prevention</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5F5E6E] mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">See who is typing in real time, tag teammates with internal notes, and approve drafts with 1 click.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
                  <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#100F12]">Automated 5-star review generation</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5F5E6E] mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">Automatically trigger Google & Trustpilot review invites right after a positive support resolution.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
                  <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#100F12]">Unified customer timeline & CRM sync</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5F5E6E] mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">Every purchase, past ticket, and channel conversation synced side-by-side in real time.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-purple-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-emerald-700 font-bold">
          <span>Average reply time: 42 seconds</span>
          <span>Lead conversion rate: 18.5% (+360%)</span>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>
